<title>UK: ADVISORY - IPE holiday trading hours.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY - IPE holiday trading hours.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Petroleum Exchange (IPE) will trade the following hours over the New Year holiday period.</p>
<p>    Friday 27 Dec    - 1730 GMT close</p>
<p>    Monday 30 Dec    - Normal trading hours</p>
<p>    Tuesday 31 Dec   - 1230 GMT close</p>
<p>    Wednesday 1 Jan  - Closed</p>
<p>    Thursday 2 Jan   - Normal trading hours</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4984</p>
